                <pb facs="0330" n="238" sameAs="frus:frus1899/pg238"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Hay to Mr.
                            Hart</hi>.</head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1898-11-19"><hi rendition="#italic">November 19,
                        1898</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>I told the Colombian minister that no further measures would be taken here until
                    I received a report from you. I told him that the instructions given you would
                    stand and you will not alter the line of conduct already directed. The matter
                    remains in your hands.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hay.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
